      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bridgewater%2C_Massachusetts"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Bridgewater State University, founded as a normal school in 1840, remains a key educational landmark in the town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bridgewater%2C_Massachusetts"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The old Bridgewater Iron Works, once a major factory, was converted into Ironworks Park after most of the building was torn down in 1994.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
